Used it a little but dropped off
They tried it but didn’t build a habit.
Never really used it
They signed up but barely explored.
Ready-to-convert users
High engagement, many sessions, clicked pricing/payment, but did not purchase.

3. 2 weeks after 15-day over
People who are now 2 weeks past their free access ending.
Classify them as:
Still warm
They opened emails or clicked links after the trial ended.
Cold
No email opens, no clicks, no platform activity.
Reactivation potential
They had good usage during the 15 days but disappeared after.
Needs education
They didn’t use much, so emails should explain what The Aura actually does and why it helps.

